---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CTASection from '../../components/CTASection.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Case Study — From Four Failed Suppliers to a Factory Partnership | Lantern Bridge"
  description="A furniture importer in Surabaya needed more than another sourcing agent — they needed a team on the ground. Here is how we crossed."
>

  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="kicker">
        <span class="txt-en">Case study</span>
        <span class="txt-id">Studi kasus</span>
      </div>
      <h1>
        <span class="txt-en">From four failed suppliers to a factory partnership.</span>
        <span class="txt-id">Dari empat pemasok gagal menjadi kemitraan pabrik.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="lead">
        <span class="txt-en">A furniture importer in Surabaya needed more than another sourcing agent — they needed a team on the ground. Here is how we crossed.</span>
        <span class="txt-id">Seorang importir furnitur di Surabaya membutuhkan lebih dari sekadar agen sourcing — mereka butuh tim di lapangan. Inilah cara kami menyeberang.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="case-grid">
        <div class="case-story">
          <div class="case-block">
            <span class="case-tag">
              <span class="txt-en">The client</span>
              <span class="txt-id">Klien</span>
            </span>
            <p>
              <span class="txt-en">An Indonesian furniture importer based in Surabaya, expanding from residential pieces into modular office furniture for the local B2B market.</span>
              <span class="txt-id">Importir furnitur Indonesia yang berbasis di Surabaya, mengembangkan lini dari furnitur residensial menjadi furnitur kantor modular untuk pasar B2B lokal.</span>
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="case-block">
            <span class="case-tag">
              <span class="txt-en">The challenge</span>
              <span class="txt-id">Tantangan</span>
            </span>
            <p>
              <span class="txt-en">After three failed attempts through online aggregators, the client had paid two deposits to factories that could not deliver the agreed specification — and lost a container to customs delays. They did not need another email broker. They needed a partner on the ground.</span>
              <span class="txt-id">Setelah tiga kali gagal melalui agregator daring, klien telah membayar dua deposit ke pabrik yang tidak dapat memenuhi spesifikasi yang disepakati — dan kehilangan satu kontainer karena penundaan bea cukai. Mereka tidak membutuhkan perantara email lagi. Mereka membutuhkan mitra di lapangan.</span>
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="case-block">
            <span class="case-tag">
              <span class="txt-en">Our approach</span>
              <span class="txt-id">Pendekatan kami</span>
            </span>
            <ol class="case-steps">
              <li>
                <b>
                  <span class="txt-en">Week 1–2 · Requirement mapping.</span>
                  <span class="txt-id">Minggu 1–2 · Pemetaan kebutuhan.</span>
                </b>
                <span class="txt-en"> We translated the client's specification sheets into Mandarin manufacturing standards and shortlisted seven candidate factories in Guangzhou and Foshan.</span>
                <span class="txt-id"> Kami menerjemahkan lembar spesifikasi klien ke standar manufaktur Mandarin dan menyaring tujuh kandidat pabrik di Guangzhou dan Foshan.</span>
              </li>
              <li>
                <b>
                  <span class="txt-en">Week 3 · On-site visits.</span>
                  <span class="txt-id">Minggu 3 · Kunjungan langsung.</span>
                </b>
                <span class="txt-en"> Our team walked the floors of all seven and filtered them to three finalists based on capacity, certifications and MOQ flexibility.</span>
                <span class="txt-id"> Tim kami mengunjungi ketujuh pabrik dan menyaringnya menjadi tiga finalis berdasarkan kapasitas, sertifikasi, dan fleksibilitas MOQ.</span>
              </li>
              <li>
                <b>
                  <span class="txt-en">Week 4 · Negotiation.</span>
                  <span class="txt-id">Minggu 4 · Negosiasi.</span>
                </b>
                <span class="txt-en"> MOQ reduced from 1,200 to 780 units; unit price down 22%. Payment terms restructured to 30/40/30 with milestone inspections.</span>
                <span class="txt-id"> MOQ turun dari 1.200 menjadi 780 unit; harga satuan turun 22%. Skema pembayaran direstrukturisasi menjadi 30/40/30 dengan inspeksi bertahap.</span>
              </li>
              <li>
                <b>
                  <span class="txt-en">Week 5–6 · Pre-shipment inspection.</span>
                  <span class="txt-id">Minggu 5–6 · Inspeksi pra-pengiriman.</span>
                </b>
                <span class="txt-en"> Two units failed quality control and were replaced before the container was sealed. Shipped on schedule.</span>
                <span class="txt-id"> Dua unit gagal kontrol kualitas dan diganti sebelum kontainer disegel. Dikirim sesuai jadwal.</span>
              </li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="case-result">
          <span class="case-tag">
            <span class="txt-en">The result</span>
            <span class="txt-id">Hasil</span>
          </span>
          <div class="case-metrics">
            <div class="case-metric">
              <strong>22%</strong>
              <span>
                <span class="txt-en">Lower unit cost</span>
                <span class="txt-id">Penurunan harga satuan</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="case-metric">
              <strong>35%</strong>
              <span>
                <span class="txt-en">Lower MOQ</span>
                <span class="txt-id">MOQ lebih rendah</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="case-metric">
              <strong>100%</strong>
              <span>
                <span class="txt-en">On-time first shipment</span>
                <span class="txt-id">Pengiriman pertama tepat waktu</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="case-metric">
              <strong>6 wks</strong>
              <span>
                <span class="txt-en">From brief to loaded container</span>
                <span class="txt-id">Dari brief hingga kontainer dimuat</span>
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="case-quote">
            <span class="txt-en">"Repeat orders are now placed quarterly — with the same factory."</span>
            <span class="txt-id">"Pesanan ulang kini dilakukan setiap kuartal — dengan pabrik yang sama."</span>
          </p>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTASection />

</Layout>

<style>
  .page-head { padding: 130px 0 40px; }
  .lead { font-size: 17px; color: var(--muted); max-width: 640px; margin-top: 12px; }
  .case-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.45fr 1fr; gap: 28px; align-items: start; }
  .case-story { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 38px 36px; }
  .case-block { margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .case-block:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .case-tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--emerald-dark); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .case-block > p { font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.7; }
  .case-steps { list-style: none; counter-reset: step; margin-top: 6px; }
  .case-steps li { counter-increment: step; position: relative; padding-left: 38px; margin: 16px 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.65; }
  .case-steps li:before { content: counter(step, decimal-leading-zero); position: absolute; left: 0; top: 1px; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--emerald-tint); color: var(--emerald-dark); display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; font-family: var(--font-body); }
  .case-steps li b { color: var(--navy); font-weight: 700; }
  .case-result { position: sticky; top: 100px; background: radial-gradient(circle at 88% 0%, rgba(14,124,91,.28), transparent 46%), linear-gradient(160deg, #0e2c4d, #081d36); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 34px 30px; color: #fff; }
  .case-result .case-tag { color: #7fd8b5; }
  .case-metrics { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; margin: 6px 0 26px; }
  .case-metric { padding: 18px 16px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13); border-radius: 14px; }
  .case-metric strong { display: block; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; line-height: 1.05; margin-bottom: 6px; font-family: var(--font-head); }
  .case-metric span { font-size: 12.5px; color: #c6d4e6; line-height: 1.4; display: block; }
  .case-quote { font-size: 14px; font-style: italic; color: #c6d4e6; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16); padding-top: 18px; line-height: 1.6; }
  [data-theme="dark"] .case-story { background: #11202f; }
  @media (max-width: 1020px) {
    .case-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 22px; }
    .case-result { position: static; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .page-head { padding: 118px 0 30px; }
    .case-story, .case-result { padding: 26px 22px; }
    .case-metrics { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
